WEBVTT

00:04:56.547 --> 00:05:01.207
"In the end, we will remember
not the words of our enemies,

00:05:01.207 --> 00:05:04.350
but the silence of our friends."

00:05:04.350 --> 00:05:06.593
So when you look in the mirror,

00:05:06.910 --> 00:05:08.623
who will you see?

00:05:09.040 --> 00:05:12.700
A bystander, keeper of open secrets?

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:16.573
Or will the person looking
back at you be an upstander?

00:05:16.794 --> 00:05:18.961
I know who I see.

00:05:19.157 --> 00:05:21.643
I know who my daughters see.

00:05:21.970 --> 00:05:24.513
The choice is yours.